      "primary_reading": "MD960 lists1076b; its solution attributes compound960 as heat-inactivated. DSMZ1076b supplies17ml swine serum separately from17ml fetal bovine serum after basal autoclaving. The55C agar holding step is a receiving-medium step, not a serum heat-inactivation schedule. All four frozen SP4-Z serum occurrences retain this scope.",
      "correction": "Existing Swine_Serum UNMAPPED_0536 creation event is authenticMD960. Promote through its exact before image/history and original filename stem. Retain prior isolated local candidate identifier with explicit oldPID bridge; do not install the prior parallel new-owner payload.",
