      "primary_reading": "CCAP MC andMCII name sterile fetal calf serum Invitrogen10109-155 with gamma irradiation. Manufacturer offers dual gamma/heat products, but does not establish heat status of this historical catalog/lot. DSM840 gives sterile bovine serum56C45min without age. ATCC1827 gives HI-FBS without schedule. ATCC243 explicitly56C30min horse serum. TOGOM2964 literally56C-Ihour fetal serum, interpreted onehour with the raw token retained.",
      "correction": "Remove categorical exclusions based on absent age or schedule, or gamma versus heat. Retain positive fetal/newborn/species/catalog/process distinctions and actual56C30/45/60minute differences; explicit active versus inactivated states remain different. No negative processing fact inferred from filtration alone.",
      "selection": "Five corrected isolated partial-material candidates with cross-source relationship holds; no forced equality, merger or arbitrary winner.",
      "relevant_context_options": {
