      "primary_reading": "JCM946 specifies rabbit serum56C30min and filtration ahead of addition, without ordering filtration relative to heat. DSM1021 requires sterile fetal OR newborn serum in1partserum:4partsbase. KOMODO1021 and16929 select newborn, preserving the preparation requirement. Its Gram/Mol columns do not establish a chemically meaningful serum mass/molar specification.",
      "correction": "Clarify treatment order and retain both treatments. Add sterility to the selected newborn preferred term and claims without assigning heat, membrane, or sterilization method. Base121C20min and later50C mixing are not serum treatment schedules.",
      "selection": "Two bounded corrected proposals; inherited histories retained verbatim with appended correction events."
    },
