      "primary_reading": "Frozen TOGOM2578 names HI-FBS170ml with newborn alternative and unknown serum schedule. The exact same source URL captured byW05 later gives ATCC0988 reformulatedMD2611, ATCC30-2020 serum,55C bath1h15min including15minwarmup and1h heat inactivation; additive solution is filter sterilized. Other changed positive recipe details include yeast-extract60ml rather than older35ml.",
